arc-plc/louisiana/iberia-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids has come in under 90% of normal in October to November in 38 of 75 years since 1951, the same count as January to February. In 2025 the middle ran 56% of normal in August to September and 51% in October to November. So far in 2026 it ran 50% of normal in February to March and 157% in April to May. Grid 11554 had its driest year in 2011 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
